Remark B.3 (Early Quarantine). The corrected quarantine threshold now depends on the noise intensity \sigma_k through \tfrac{1}{2}\sigma_k^2 \geq \alpha_k + \sum_{j \neq k}\|\mathbf{C}_{kj}\|. Jurisdictions with higher stochastic volatility require earlier quarantine activation. The condition that the remaining sub-matrix is a nonsingular M-matrix is essential and must be verified explicitly.

